---
source: crates/surfaces/cli/src/main.rs
expression: command.clone().render_long_help().to_string()
---
Generate shell completions: the built-in commands, and the commands of the extensions the project at --path enables

Usage: specforge completions [OPTIONS] <SHELL>

Arguments:
  <SHELL>
          Target shell
          
          [possible values: bash, elvish, fish, powershell, zsh]

Options:
      --path <PATH>
          A path inside the project (the nearest directory at or above it holding specforge.json; none: the directory itself, with the default configuration)
          
          [default: .]

  -h, --help
          Print help
